 be the  leader of the divine truth cult  disguising himself as a street performer  to scout potential talents back to the  present day the exhausted luchan is  brought into the encampment and a medic  dong is tasked to treat him  dong tells him that he will die if he  keeps fighting as his berserk mode  drains his energy instead of making him  stronger if he wants to live he needs to  balance his energy and project it onto a  softer calmer version of kung fu  he advises learning kung fu style from  the village of chen jiagoo  other people at the encampment ridicule  dong's suggestion but luchan seems to  take it seriously later that evening the  encampment is raided by the kingdom's  army luchan survives the raid  remembering dong's last message to go to  chen jiagu and presents himself to  master chen chang singh so he can learn  chen kung fu  after venturing for days he finally  reaches the village but the villagers do  not welcome him warmly he expresses his  intention to learn chen kung fu to which  the villagers always reply that they do  not teach it to outsiders  then lu chan is hit by a steam engine  driven by fang xi jing and his fiancee  yoon yong  yoon yong comes to him and asks if he is  all right she tells him to contact her  if there is anything she can help with  in the evening xi jing and yong hold a  meeting with the townspeople  xi jing a local who received education  in western countries has just been made  the chief of railroad project tasked to  construct a railway that will pass  through the chen village  the trains will transport sugar and  goods from the west in exchange for  local herbal products of the chen  village  he attempts to convince the villagers  that western technologies will make  their future better by installing  electric bulbs around the room  however it short circuits and blows up  disappointing the village elders the  next day luchan meets you nyong and her  apothecary  he asks her to bring him to grandmaster  chan with the intention to learn kung fu  she instructs him to go to mount wu  liang  luchan quickly heads there but he could  not find him  confused he returns to you nyong and  explains that the grandmaster is nowhere  to be found yoon yong replies that the  grand master can be anywhere after all  they are not allowed to teach chen kung  fu to outsiders lu chan gets angry over  the statement and attacks you nyong but  she defeats him easily an old villager  takes luchan and heals him  he deduces that luchan is dying and his  determination to learn chen kung fu is  driven by his desire to recover from his  condition  meanwhile xi jing is desperate as the  chen villagers refuse to give their  lands for the railroad project although  he is a distant cousin of the chen  family and was raised in the village he  was treated as an outsider and not  allowed to learn chen kung fu  even after he got back to chen village  with the intention to help the people  after getting his western education the  people still looked down on him he  compares himself to you nyong the  daughter of grandmaster chen loved by  everyone in the village the next day  luchan challenges yunyong again to a  kung fu battle yoon yong defeats him  again then banishes him from the village  meanwhile z jing negotiates with his  company's shareholders he enlists the  help of claire a representative of the  east india trading company to deal with  the villagers  lu chan still determined to learn chen  kung fu tries many ways to get back  inside the village but the villagers  always defeat him  the old villager who seems the  friendliest to him advises him that he  can learn chen kung fu by imitating the  villagers moves perfectly this makes him  pick more fights with the villagers so  he can observe their movements and  imitate them one day he fights brother  tofu a local tofu vendor he finally  defeats brother tofu with his imitations  of the chen kung fu which fascinates the  villagers  after feeling a great force pushing him  from behind to strike a significant blow  luchan falls unconscious claire and xi  jing arrive back at the village by  riding an enormous steam-powered  railway-laying machine called troy that  can destroy everything in its path to  make way for the railroad yoon yong  begged xi jing to not destroy the  village although he is firm on his  decision  claire realizes that jing's personal  attachment to yong in the village can  cause him to be reluctant to destroy the  village yoo nyong brings the issue to  the village elders council but they  refuse to take any action while  grandmaster chan is still away  lu chan wakes up and his helper tells  him about troy that will destroy the  village  he advises him to break the engine to  save the village and be the village's  hero  that way maybe the villagers are willing  to teach him chen kung fu  meanwhile z jing confesses his love to  claire  unbeknownst to both yoo nyong observes  them from the roof then interrupts them  while secretly taking the troy engine  handbook  she enlists the help of a post officer  to translate the book while lu chan and  the helper deduce plans to secretly  infiltrate troy and destroy it with a  carefully thought plan luchan  infiltrates the engine and defeats  several guards but finds it difficult to  break the engine  fortunately union also infiltrates the  engine with the same intention then they  work together to find the engine's weak  spot a surviving soldier sounds the  emergency alarm causing zjing and claire  to check the engine although xi jing  warns young that they will be enemies if  she destroys the engine union is still  determined to destroy it then it  explodes  claire gets fatally injured and dies in  xi jing's arms making him vow to avenge  her by decimating the chen village  liu chan and yong run back to the  village where he discovers that his  mysterious helper all this time is  actually grandmaster cheng himself the  grand master originally planned to use  an outsider which is lu chan to destroy  the troy engine so that no chen villager  is involved in its destruction  however since yong also played a part in  breaking the engine he is certain that  an army will come to their village so  they shall be prepared  the villagers prepare for the upcoming  battle under grandmaster chen's  directions he advises them to not hurt  the enemies only to drive them away  liu chan also participates to help the  villagers he steps in front of young to  save her from a bullet making it hit him  instead  he demonstrates his imitations of chen  kung fu to defeat the army with  carefully planned tactics the villagers  win and the rest of the army scramble  away the badly injured luchan is taken  to the elders council as they are  debating whether he should be punished  for stealing the chen kung fu  yoong defends him by saying he imitated  chen kung fu openly by fighting with  local villagers and the villagers have  been observing him  however the elders are still firm on  their determination that no outsider  should learn chen kung fu after her  father advises her yoong exclaims that  she can settle the problem by marrying  lu chan making him his husband and  changing his status as no longer an  outsider to the chen village during the  marriage ceremony two mysterious  outsiders are seen entering the village  they refuse to be rerouted and insist on  entering the village despite being  warned by one of the villagers  a battle ensues between them  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching
 

